rder: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">우아한형제들 기술이사가 직접 설계하여</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">개발의 기초부터 실전 프로젝트까지 전부 경험할 수 있는<br></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">전액무료 프론트엔드 개발 부트캠프를 통해 실력있는</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">개발자로 성장하세요.</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">개발 경력 30년, 개발자 교육 경력 12년에</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">우아한형제들 개발자 채용 및 사내외 교육을 진행해온</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">강사님만의 개발 노하우를 담은 고퀄리티 학습 커리큘럼!</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">전액 국비지원으로 배워 7개월만에 기업이 원하는</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">신입 개발자 역량을 갖출 수 있습니다.</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">[패스트캠퍼스 데브캠프 : 김민태의 프론트엔드 개발] 수강생 모집</font></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(244, 204, 204);\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);\">1. 모집 대상</span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 197, 233);\"></span></font></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 대학교 3학년 이상 휴학생 혹은 휴학예정자</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 평일 10시부터 19시까지 실시간으로 참여 할 수 있는 분</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">2. 모집 개요</font></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 모집 기간 : 3월 28일(목) ~ 5월 1일(수) 자정 마감</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 합격 발표 : 24년 5월 14일(화)(개별 연락)</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 과정 기간 : 24년 5월 20일(월) ~ 24년 12월 13일(금)</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 12px;\"></span><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">3. 수업 방식</font></span></div><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(80, 0, 80);\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 실시간 온라인 수업 * 필요시 강남역 도보 1분거리 오프라인 학습장 제공</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 수강생의 학습수준과 원하는 취업 분야에 맞춘 맞춤형 교육 제공</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 대표 강사가 직접 설계한 실시간 강의와 온라인 강의, 프로젝트 총 3번의 반복 학습으로 탄탄한 기본기 생성</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 이력서 첨삭 &amp; 면접 준비 등 전문 취업 컨설턴트의 1:1 커리어 서비스 제공</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 실전 모의코딩테스트로 취업까지 완벽 대비</font></div></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">4. 프라이빗 사전 설명회</font></span></span></div><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(80, 0, 80);\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">-&nbsp;일시 및 장소 : 2024. 4. 24(수) 19:00, Zoom 비대면 화상 회의</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 대상 : ~ 4. 23(화)까지 사전신청 하신 분들 모두</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">- 내용</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><ol style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 40px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal;\"><li style=\"margin-left: 15px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">교육 담당자 섹션: 데브캠프의 커리큘럼과 커리어 서비스에 대한 상세한 소개</font></li><li style=\"margin-left: 15px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">김민태 강사님 섹션: 강사님이 직접 들려주는 프론트엔드 현직 이야기와 강의 소개</font></li><li style=\"margin-left: 15px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Q&amp;A: 김민태 강사님과 함께 프론트엔드 개발에 대한 모든 궁금증을 풀어보는 시간</font></li></ol></div></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">전직&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">우아한형제들 기술 이사</span>&nbsp;김민태님이 직접 소개해 주는 프론트엔드 개발자 역량과</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">취업 과정이 궁금하다면<span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;</span>4월 24일 수요일 프라이빗 사전설명회에서 만나요!</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">※ 사전설명회 참석 초대장은 사전 신청 하신 분 대상으로 일괄 발송됩니다. ※</font></div></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">5. 지원 방법</font></span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">1) 하단 링크에서 신청하기 버튼 클릭</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">2) 사전 접수 완료시 자기소개서 제출 등 안내 메일 발송</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">3) 비대면 녹화 면접까지 완료하면 지원 성공</font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">▶김민태의 데브캠프 신청 바로가기 :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bit.ly/4a6Ar8l\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(75, 75, 75);\">https://bit.ly/4a6Ar8l</a></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertic